Applicable for Retail(Retail MDF), IPA, Channel MDF programs.</description>
        <formula>AND( OR( AND( Core_MDF_Program__c = &apos;Retail Marketing Funds&apos;, TEXT(Core_MDF_Budget_Type_Options_Nm__c) = $Label.Core_MDF_RetailMDF_BudgetType ) , Core_MDF_Program__c = &apos;Intel Partner Alliance&apos;) ,

